From 2201958ff69021db605e37406ce76e08ccbf92c0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cliffhall <cliff@futurescale.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 23:17:04 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] ci(python): one validate chain per server, a root
 validate:py, ruff in CI

scripts/validate-py.mjs runs uv sync --locked, ruff check, ruff format
--check, pyright, pytest and uv build in each Python server (discovered
by pyproject.toml). npm run validate:py runs it for every server; the
python.yml test job runs it per matrix package, so CI now fails on a
ruff lint or format finding.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: cliffhall <cliff@futurescale.com>
